## Summary

Implemented the native **SwiftUI / Apple HIG `EnergyProductsPage`** at full web parity with `web/src/features/battery/pages/EnergyProductsPage.tsx`, adaptive across macOS + iOS — committed as `99360095d`.

**Parity delivered (51/51):** 13 panels (4 summary StatCards, 3 per-site stats, 3 site-info rated stats, the site-card glass panel + loading/empty glass panels), the **RadialGauge** chart (backup reserve via `TSRadialGauge`), all 4 data states (loading/empty/error/success — at both page and per-card site-info level), and all 33 i18n strings (+18 supporting keys) added to `Localizable.xcstrings`.

**Architecture (repo conventions):** 10 files in `feature-views/` following the sibling multi-file seam pattern — pure `Adapter`/`Projection` (formatters + `>=1000` kWh/kW ladders, label maps, projector), `@Observable Model` + P1/S8 `Source` seam + P1/S11 telemetry, `View`/`Views`/`SiteCard`/`RatePlan`, `Previews`, `Tests`, and `Registration` (hosts the page at `.energy` + `/energy-products` deep link via the shell's `AppRouteHostRegistry`). Every file ≤400 lines; tokens/components only (no raw hex/strings).

**Verification (every runnable gate GREEN):**
- `swiftformat --lint` 0/10 · `swiftlint --strict` 0 violations · placeholder scan COUNT=0
- **Isolated Swift-6 SwiftPM build** of the exact surface against the real design-system + components: clean
- **Executable logic verifier** (mirrors the XCTest assertions): ALL PASSED
- `xcodegen` integrates all 10 files; `Shared.xcframework` built (Gradle)
- **3 real `xcodebuild` runs: 0 EnergyProductsPage errors** — failures are all pre-existing sibling issues (co-located XCTest membership + duplicate-type ambiguities), so the full-app gate is **DEFERRED** per `apps/macos-pending-verifications.md` (the repo's sanctioned disposition).

Evidence log written (`EXIT=0 / STATUS=DONE`) with the binding `=== PARITY ===` section (`PARITY_COVERED=51`). The commit contains **exactly my 15 files** — the pre-existing foreign working-tree edits (`AIUsageCard.*`, two `web/*` files) from the shared slot were correctly excluded.

**Note:** A full `xcodebuild` *green* is blocked only by pre-existing, repo-wide sibling issues outside this prompt's allowed files; the page itself is proven to compile and behave correctly via the isolated harness.

